# Always Test Before Done

A task is **not complete** until behavior is verified the way a real user/system would use it.

## Required for every change

1. **Automated tests**
   - **Do not add or modify test files** unless the user explicitly asks — see **`agent-test-cleanup.mdc`**. Delete/revert any tests you created before handoff.
   - Run **existing** targeted tests when helpful; report command + pass/fail in the final reply.

2. **User-visible flows**
   - UI/storefront changes: follow **`verify-ui-before-done.mdc`** and **`rigorous-qa-before-handoff.mdc`** — filter combinations, full action flows, Playwright e2e when applicable; open the real page and confirm outcomes on real/seeded data.
   - API-only changes: hit the same endpoints the client will use; do not rely on code inspection alone.

3. **Integration dependencies**
   - If the feature calls another service (e.g. `plamod_scraper`, queue worker), smoke-test that dependency after code changes.
   - After **Node/scraper** changes: restart `pricing-tool-plamod-scraper` and confirm `/health` lists required routes.

## Test placement guide

| Change type | Minimum tests |
| --- | --- |
| API route/controller | `tests/Feature/Api/V1/...` |
| Service/business logic | `tests/Feature/Services/...` or unit test |
| Vue page / interaction | `resources/js/pages/__tests__/...` (Vitest) |
| External client (HTTP) | Fake HTTP + assert error mapping |
| Reported bug | Reproduction test in the same PR/change set |

## Commands (pricing-tool)

- Backend: `php artisan test --filter=<Name>`
- Frontend: `npm run test -- --run <spec-path>`
- Frontend bundle after UI edits: `npm run build`
- **OVS T&S collection filters (theme + manifest):**
  - `php artisan shopify:storefront-collection-filters-manifest-verify` (no network; catches missing collections)
  - `npm run test:e2e:storefront-filters` (live storefront check→uncheck + mobile sync + **combinationCases** from manifest)
- **Staff orders report (`StaffOrdersReportPage`, staff-orders API):**
  - `php artisan test tests/Feature/Api/V1/StaffOrdersReportTest.php`
  - `npm run test:e2e -- tests/e2e/staff-orders-report.spec.ts`
  - Browser: `/reports/staff-orders` must show **days in month > 0** after load (see **`staff-orders-report.mdc`**)
- **PLAMOD restock new-products section (`PlamodRestockPage`, filters, include/exclude/bulk):**
  - `php artisan test tests/Feature/Api/V1/PlamodRestockTest.php`
  - `npm run test:e2e -- tests/e2e/plamod-restock-new-section.spec.ts`
  - Browser: `/restocking/plamod` — filter combos, include/exclude, real row counts (see **`rigorous-qa-before-handoff.mdc`**)

## Final reply must include

- Which tests were run and whether they passed.
- A **QA matrix** (URL, actions, pass/fail evidence) per **`rigorous-qa-before-handoff.mdc`** when user-visible behavior changed.
- If UI was tested: URL, actions performed, and pass/fail vs customer expectation (see `verify-ui-before-done.mdc`).
- If something could not be run, why and what unblocks it.

Do **not** mark a feature “done” after only writing code or only running unrelated tests.
